"\\leq_T\\subseteq T\\times T\">\\(\\leq_T\\subseteq T\\times T\\)</span> (tree order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\subseteq T\">\\(b\\subseteq T\\)</span> (branch candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in b\">\\(x,y\\in b\\)</span> (branch elements bound in the linearity clause)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in T\">\\(z\\in T\\)</span> (predecessor element bound in the downward-closure clause)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8BranchThroughTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8BranchThroughTree}_S\\)</span> (canonical maximal-branch predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TreeBranch}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TreeBranch}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree\\text{-}branch} \\vdash \\mathrm{TreeBranch}_S(b,T,\\leq_T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTree8BranchThroughTree}_S(b,T,\\leq_T)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree\\text{-}branch} \\vdash \\mathrm{TreeBranch}_S(b,T,\\leq_T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTree8BranchThroughTree}_S(b,T,\\leq_T)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is an exact alias of the sourced downward-closed maximal-chain predicate; the former clause omitted maximality.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-2","